{"4114350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Remains of Dahlia", "steam_appid": 4114350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> is a short first-person investigative psychological horror game about a husband trying to uncover the truth behind his wife’s disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2010s, a housewife known as <strong>“Dahlia”</strong> was reported missing after running away from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her husband, <strong>Bowo</strong>, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.poster.avif?t=1764936266\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.webm?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.mp4?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> delivers an  investigative experience through its authentic setting, where players will explore a small house and its surrounding area located in a quiet, remote suburban neighborhood in Indonesia. With its <strong>old camcorder-style visuals</strong>, the game evokes a chilling atmosphere reminiscent of a documentary capturing real events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>investigative gameplay</strong>, players are encouraged to search every corner, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind Dahlia’s disappearance while feeling the <strong>tense and oppressive silence</strong> that lingers within every step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision and interpretation of the evidence will lead to <strong>multiple possible endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Remains of Dahlia</i></strong><i> is a short game, designed to be completed roughly in under one hour.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> is a short first-person investigative psychological horror game about a husband trying to uncover the truth behind his wife’s disappearance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early 2010s, a housewife known as <strong>“Dahlia”</strong> was reported missing after running away from home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her husband, <strong>Bowo</strong>, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.poster.avif?t=1764936266\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.webm?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/extras/9c8d762ecda3b27c1d34f99ee725f1f7.mp4?t=1764936266\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Remains of Dahlia</strong> delivers an  investigative experience through its authentic setting, where players will explore a small house and its surrounding area located in a quiet, remote suburban neighborhood in Indonesia. With its <strong>old camcorder-style visuals</strong>, the game evokes a chilling atmosphere reminiscent of a documentary capturing real events. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through <strong>investigative gameplay</strong>, players are encouraged to search every corner, uncover hidden clues, and piece together the truth behind Dahlia’s disappearance while feeling the <strong>tense and oppressive silence</strong> that lingers within every step. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision and interpretation of the evidence will lead to <strong>multiple possible endings</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>The Remains of Dahlia</i></strong><i> is a short game, designed to be completed roughly in under one hour.</i></p>", "short_description": "In the early 2010s, a housewife known as “Dahlia” was reported missing after running away from home. Her husband, Bowo, filed a report with the police, but the investigation yielded no results. With no clear answers, Bowo decided to investigate the case on his own.", "supported_languages": "English, Indonesian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/72e38b183a73ecd25c9dc07a070b3d2439080e58/header.jpg?t=1764936266", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/02e668d08ec15f392ac4b00b8fe1cf1fff824c92/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764936266", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4114350/02e668d08ec15f392ac4b00b8fe1cf1fff824c92/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764936266", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<